{ "period": "2019 - 2024" }

### Reorder. One request per drag-and-drop commit, rather than one PATCH per
# row — which is what a list of any length would otherwise cost.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/educations/order
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "id": "{{educationId}}", "order": 20 }
  ]
}

### Delete.
